{"seq":1,"slug":"relational-algebra","title":"关系代数","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/database-systems/relational-model/relational-algebra","wordCount":809,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"关系代数\">关系代数</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>关系代数是关系数据库理论的数学基础，它定义了一组对关系（表）进行操作的运算，每个运算的输入和输出都是关系。理解关系代数有助于深入掌握 SQL 查询的本质——SQL 实质上是关系代数的声明式表达。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[关系 R] --&gt; OP[关系运算]&#10;    B[关系 S] --&gt; OP&#10;    OP --&gt; C[结果关系]\">graph LR\n    A[关系 R] --&gt; OP[关系运算]\n    B[关系 S] --&gt; OP\n    OP --&gt; C[结果关系]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>运算类别</th>\n<th>运算符</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>一元运算</td>\n<td>选择 σ</td>\n<td>按条件筛选行</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>一元运算</td>\n<td>投影 π</td>\n<td>选取特定列</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>一元运算</td>\n<td>重命名 ρ</td>\n<td>重命名关系或属性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>二元运算</td>\n<td>并 ∪</td>\n<td>两个关系的合并</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>二元运算</td>\n<td>差 −</td>\n<td>从一个关系减去另一个</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>二元运算</td>\n<td>笛卡尔积 ×</td>\n<td>两个关系的全组合</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>二元运算</td>\n<td>连接 ⋈</td>\n<td>按条件组合两个关系</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>二元运算</td>\n<td>除法 ÷</td>\n<td>找出满足&quot;全部&quot;条件的元组</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"基本运算\">基本运算</h2><h3 id=\"选择-selection\">选择（Selection）σ</h3><p>选择运算从关系中筛选出满足条件的元组（行）：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"σ_age&gt;25(Employee)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>σ_age>25(Employee)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>等价 SQL：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"SELECT * FROM Employee WHERE age &gt; 25;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Employee </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> age </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 25</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"投影-projection\">投影（Projection）π</h3><p>投影运算从关系中选取特定的属性（列）并去除重复：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"π_name,salary(Employee)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>π_name,salary(Employee)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>等价 SQL：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"SELECT DISTINCT name, salary FROM Employee;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT DISTINCT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, salary </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Employee;</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"组合运算\">组合运算</h3><p>选择与投影可以组合使用：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"π_name,salary(σ_dept=&#39;Engineering&#39;(Employee))\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>π_name,salary(σ_dept='Engineering'(Employee))</span></span></code></pre></div><p>等价 SQL：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"SELECT DISTINCT name, salary FROM Employee WHERE dept = &#39;Engineering&#39;;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT DISTINCT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, salary </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Employee </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dept </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'Engineering'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"集合操作\">集合操作</h2><p>集合操作要求两个关系具有<strong>相同的属性结构</strong>（并兼容）。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>操作</th>\n<th>符号</th>\n<th>语义</th>\n<th>SQL 等价</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>并</td>\n<td>R ∪ S</td>\n<td>R 和 S 的所有元组（去重）</td>\n<td>UNION</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>交</td>\n<td>R ∩ S</td>\n<td>同时出现在 R 和 S 中的</td>\n<td>INTERSECT</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>差</td>\n<td>R − S</td>\n<td>在 R 中但不在 S 中的</td>\n<td>EXCEPT</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 并运算：所有员工和实习生&#10;SELECT name FROM Employee&#10;UNION&#10;SELECT name FROM Intern;&#10;&#10;-- 差运算：有员工身份但不是经理的人&#10;SELECT emp_id FROM Employee&#10;EXCEPT&#10;SELECT emp_id FROM Manager;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 并运算：所有员工和实习生</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> name</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Employee</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">UNION</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> name</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Intern;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 差运算：有员工身份但不是经理的人</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> emp_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Employee</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">EXCEPT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> emp_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Manager;</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"连接运算\">连接运算</h2><p>连接是关系代数中最重要的二元运算，它将两个关系按照某种条件组合。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    subgraph 连接类型&#10;        A[笛卡尔积 ×] --&gt; B[θ-连接]&#10;        B --&gt; C[等值连接]&#10;        C --&gt; D[自然连接 ⋈]&#10;        E[外连接] --&gt; F[左外连接]&#10;        E --&gt; G[右外连接]&#10;        E --&gt; H[全外连接]&#10;    end\">graph TD\n    subgraph 连接类型\n        A[笛卡尔积 ×] --&gt; B[θ-连接]\n        B --&gt; C[等值连接]\n        C --&gt; D[自然连接 ⋈]\n        E[外连接] --&gt; F[左外连接]\n        E --&gt; G[右外连接]\n        E --&gt; H[全外连接]\n    end</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>连接类型</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n<th>SQL 关键字</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>笛卡尔积</td>\n<td>两关系所有元组的全排列组合</td>\n<td>CROSS JOIN</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>θ-连接</td>\n<td>笛卡尔积后按条件 θ 过滤</td>\n<td>JOIN ... ON</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>等值连接</td>\n<td>θ-连接中条件为等号</td>\n<td>JOIN ... ON a = b</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>自然连接</td>\n<td>等值连接 + 自动匹配同名属性 + 去重复列</td>\n<td>NATURAL JOIN</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>左外连接</td>\n<td>保留左关系所有元组，右侧无匹配则补 NULL</td>\n<td>LEFT OUTER JOIN</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 自然连接&#10;SELECT * FROM Employee NATURAL JOIN Department;&#10;&#10;-- 等值连接&#10;SELECT e.name, d.dept_name&#10;FROM Employee e&#10;JOIN Department d ON e.dept_id = d.dept_id;&#10;&#10;-- 左外连接&#10;SELECT e.name, d.dept_name&#10;FROM Employee e&#10;LEFT JOIN Department d ON e.dept_id = d.dept_id;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 自然连接</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Employee </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NATURAL JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Department;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 等值连接</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">d</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">dept_name</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Employee e</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Department d </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ON</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">dept_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> d</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">dept_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 左外连接</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">d</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">dept_name</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Employee e</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">LEFT JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Department d </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ON</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">dept_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> d</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">dept_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"除法运算\">除法运算</h2><p>除法运算用于解决&quot;全称量化&quot;问题，即找出与某个集合中<strong>所有元素</strong>都有关联的元组。</p>\n<p>假设关系 <code>选课(学生, 课程)</code> 和 <code>必修课(课程)</code>，求选修了所有必修课的学生：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"选课 ÷ 必修课\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>选课 ÷ 必修课</span></span></code></pre></div><p>等价 SQL：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"SELECT 学生&#10;FROM 选课&#10;GROUP BY 学生&#10;HAVING COUNT(DISTINCT 课程) = (SELECT COUNT(*) FROM 必修课)&#10;   AND NOT EXISTS (&#10;       SELECT 课程 FROM 必修课&#10;       WHERE 课程 NOT IN (&#10;           SELECT 课程 FROM 选课 AS sc WHERE sc.学生 = 选课.学生&#10;       )&#10;   );\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> 学生</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> 选课</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> 学生</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">HAVING</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> COUNT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DISTINCT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> 课程) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> COUNT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> 必修课)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   AND</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> EXISTS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">       SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> 课程 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> 必修课</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">       WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> 课程 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">           SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> 课程 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> 选课 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sc </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> sc</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">学生</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 选课</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">学生</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">       )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">   );</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"关系代数表达式优化\">关系代数表达式优化</h2><p>查询优化器在执行 SQL 前，会将其转换为关系代数表达式并进行等价变换以提升性能。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>优化规则</th>\n<th>变换</th>\n<th>效果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>选择下推</td>\n<td>σ(R ⋈ S) → σ(R) ⋈ S</td>\n<td>减少连接数据量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>投影下推</td>\n<td>π(R ⋈ S) → π(π(R) ⋈ π(S))</td>\n<td>减少中间列数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>选择与笛卡尔积合并</td>\n<td>σ*θ(R × S) → R ⋈*θ S</td>\n<td>避免全组合</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>选择条件分解</td>\n<td>σ_(c1∧c2)(R) → σ_c1(σ_c2(R))</td>\n<td>逐步过滤</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((关系代数))&#10;    一元运算&#10;      选择 σ 筛选行&#10;      投影 π 选取列&#10;      重命名 ρ&#10;    集合运算&#10;      并 ∪&#10;      交 ∩&#10;      差 −&#10;    连接运算&#10;      自然连接&#10;      θ-连接&#10;      外连接&#10;    除法运算&#10;      全称量化问题&#10;    表达式优化&#10;      选择下推&#10;      投影下推\">mindmap\n  root((关系代数))\n    一元运算\n      选择 σ 筛选行\n      投影 π 选取列\n      重命名 ρ\n    集合运算\n      并 ∪\n      交 ∩\n      差 −\n    连接运算\n      自然连接\n      θ-连接\n      外连接\n    除法运算\n      全称量化问题\n    表达式优化\n      选择下推\n      投影下推</pre><ul>\n<li><strong>关系代数</strong>是 SQL 的数学基础，每个 SQL 查询都可以表示为关系代数表达式。</li>\n<li><strong>选择</strong>和<strong>投影</strong>是最基本的一元运算，分别过滤行和选取列。</li>\n<li><strong>连接</strong>是最重要的二元运算，自然连接和外连接是实际中最常用的形式。</li>\n<li><strong>除法</strong>解决&quot;全部满足&quot;类问题，在 SQL 中通常用 <code>NOT EXISTS</code> 子查询实现。</li>\n<li>查询优化器通过<strong>选择下推、投影下推</strong>等等价变换来优化关系代数表达式。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"关系代数","id":"关系代数"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"基本运算","id":"基本运算"},{"level":3,"text":"选择（Selection）σ","id":"选择-selection"},{"level":3,"text":"投影（Projection）π","id":"投影-projection"},{"level":3,"text":"组合运算","id":"组合运算"},{"level":2,"text":"集合操作","id":"集合操作"},{"level":2,"text":"连接运算","id":"连接运算"},{"level":2,"text":"除法运算","id":"除法运算"},{"level":2,"text":"关系代数表达式优化","id":"关系代数表达式优化"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":null,"next":{"title":"范式与规范化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/database-systems/relational-model/normalization"}}